{
  "$comment": "The weather-stations app catalog: the default baker run (`mise run bake`) compiles these animations into ../catalog/weather.mlvc in this order, which is the order of icon-animation's enum values after \"none\", and writes their credits and license texts to ../catalog/weather.mlvc.LICENSE.txt. Apps load it at run time: the gallery with loadCatalog, the native viewer with --catalog. Meteocons flat style from @meteocons/lottie 3.0.0-next.10 (see LICENSES.md). Every entry shares one anchor box, the union of the 12 content boxes rounded out, so all icons draw at the same scale and anchor; displayPx 48 applies to its longer side (103 canvas px), and maxDisplayPx keeps its default, 4 x displayPx. Baked at 30 fps to keep the committed file small, except wind at 60, whose dash marches 2.6 px per 30 fps step. Fields: see CatalogEntry in ../baker/src/bake.ts.",
